  <prompt>
    On Create-Analysis wizard finish (agreement work-type): bridge the durable sprk_document into session file context,
    bind the session durably to the Analysis, auto-dispatch the agreement review, and render advisory comments in the
    already-open editable Compose — no manual re-upload. NOTE (hub answer Q2, 2026-07-31): the promote silent-FK gap is
    FIXED BY THE HUB (their bug, their closeout item) — do NOT implement the fix here; VERIFY their fix landed before
    relying on promote, and keep the durable-bind acceptance regardless.
  </prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Session dispatch file resolution, fork/promote contracts, wizard finish seam, BFF durability.</role>
  <goal>Wizard-finish yields: bound session (visible via by-analysis), review dispatched on the right pack, comments in Compose — one flow, durable.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Verified impedance (HUB-R1-REVIEW §5): the wizard produces a durable sprk_document
      (sprk_graphitemid/sprk_graphdriveid via EntityCreationService, CreateAnalysisWizardWidget.tsx master :636-658);
      dispatch consumes SESSION-uploaded fileIds only (SessionDispatchOrchestrator.ResolveTargetFiles :689-769, hard
