  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare rigor; check Phase-1 owner-UAT status (hub Q5) AND verify the hub's promote FK fix landed (their Q2 closeout — commit flagged in their answer doc); if either is outstanding, escalate before building; audit the session file-registration seam (does an SPE-pointer registration path exist?).</step>
