    <step order="2">Verify the hub's promote FK fix empirically (promote a session with no pre-existing summary row -> durable FK exists or a non-2xx/warning surfaces); record the verification. Do NOT re-implement.</step>
    <step order="3">Implement the finish hook: bridge file → bind session → auto-dispatch (per 023's pack) → comments render via 030/031's durable path.</step>
