  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Wizard-finish on an agreement: review auto-runs on the selected type's pack; advisory comments render in the open Compose; no manual re-upload.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">GET /sessions/by-analysis/{analysisId} returns the bound session (durable FK proven) — the silent-FK gap cannot produce a 201-without-FK on this path (regression test).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Dispatch resolves the bridged file (no "No session files were available" error).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: bridge failure / bind failure / dispatch failure each surface a distinct visible error; the Analysis record's state remains consistent (no orphan half-flows).</criterion>
